<title>INDIA: India's Thomas Cook offers 2:3 bonus shr.</title>
<headline>India's Thomas Cook offers 2:3 bonus shr.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas Cook India Ltd said on Monday it would offer shareholders two bonus shares for every three shares held.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
